cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "COFT: Counterfactual-Conformal Decoding for Fair Chain-of-Thought Reasoning in Large Language Models"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of COFT (Chain of Fair Thought), a training-free
  decoding method that applies token-level fairness control at decode time with
  distribution-free marginal validity guarantees (under exchangeability) for any
  frozen causal language model.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
